 chandelure: {mechanism:'**Choice Specs raises Special Attack but locks Chandelure into one move** until it switches. Flash Fire grants a Fire immunity, and Trick can exchange items with an eligible target — though not every held item can be traded away.',decisions:[{when:'A bulky target switches in to wall you',action:'**Trick can cripple the very switch-in that resists your locked move,** which is often worth more than a weakened attack. Some items and targets are exempt, so treat it as a trade, not a reset.'},{when:'You expect a Fire attack',action:'Flash Fire absorbs it and strengthens Flamethrower. **Water, Ground, Rock, Ghost and Dark answers are all super effective,** so the immunity does not cover Chandelure’s real matchups.'}]},
